RizqHub

RizqHub is a web application designed to facilitate donations to local mosques. The platform empowers individuals and communities to contribute effortlessly to mosques in need, fostering unity and support through a centralized and user-friendly system.

Features

Easy Donations: Securely donate to your local mosque with just a few clicks.

Donation Tracking: Track your donation history to stay updated on your contributions.

Search Local Mosques: Discover mosques near you and view their profiles.

Transparent Campaigns: View donation campaigns initiated by mosques, including goals and progress.

Secure Payments: Integrates with trusted payment gateways to ensure safe transactions.


Technologies Used

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript


Usage

Sign Up/Login:

Create an account or log in to access the platform.

Search for Mosques:

Use the search feature to find local mosques.

Donate:

Select a mosque or campaign and proceed with the donation process.

Track Donations:

View your donation history under your profile.